cff-version: 1.2.0
title: Geospatial Analysis in Python
message: If you use these materials, please cite them as below.
type: dataset
authors:
  - family-names: Mironova
    given-names: Bella
abstract: >-
  An open interactive guide to working with spatial data in Python: spatial data
  formats, coordinate reference systems, geoprocessing, network analysis, raster
  analysis and interactive maps, built around a single project on the
  accessibility of everyday amenities in a city.
keywords:
  - geospatial analysis
  - python
  - geopandas
  - openstreetmap
  - urban data
  - teaching materials
  - vienna
